<title>JAPAN: Olympic Sports says applied for court mediation.</title>
<headline>Olympic Sports says applied for court mediation.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olympic Sports Co said on Friday that it had applied for court mediation with creditors.</p>
